\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 1. Nh\'f3m t\'ednh n\uc0\u259 ng \u272 i\u7873 u h\u432 \u7899 ng & T\'ecm \u273 \u432 \u7901 ng th\'f4ng minh (Navigation & Routing)\
