\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 G\uc0\u7907 i \'fd l\u7897  tr\'ecnh n\'e9 \u273 i\u7875 m ng\u7853 p/b\'e3o:
\f1\b0  T\'edch h\uc0\u7907 p b\u7843 n \u273 \u7891  ch\u7881  \u273 \u432 \u7901 ng (nh\u432  Google Maps/Mapbox API) cho ph\'e9p ng\u432 \u7901 i d\'f9ng nh\u7853 p \u273 i\u7875 m \u273 i - \u273 i\u7875 m \u273 \u7871 n. H\u7879  th\u7889 ng t\u7921  \u273 \u7897 ng t\'ednh to\'e1n l\u7897  tr\'ecnh n\'e9 c\'e1c \u273 i\u7875 m \u273 ang c\'f3 c\u7843 nh b\'e1o ng\u7853 p s\'e2u, c\'e2y \u273 \u7893  ho\u7863 c \'f9n t\u7855 c nghi\'eam tr\u7885 ng. \
