\f1\b0  Ph\'e1t c\uc0\u7843 nh b\'e1o b\u7857 ng gi\u7885 ng n\'f3i ho\u7863 c \'e2m thanh ng\u7855 n khi ng\u432 \u7901 i d\'f9ng di chuy\u7875 n chu\u7849 n b\u7883  ti\u7871 n v\'e0o v\'f9ng b\'e1n k\'ednh (v\'ed d\u7909 : 500m) \u273 ang c\'f3 s\u7921  c\u7889  th\u7901 i ti\u7871 t nghi\'eam tr\u7885 ng do c\u7897 ng \u273 \u7891 ng v\u7915 a b\'e1o c\'e1o. \
