\f1\b0  K\uc0\u7871 t h\u7907 p hi\u7875 n th\u7883  d\u7919  li\u7879 u d\u7921  b\'e1o th\u7901 i ti\u7871 t ch\'ednh th\u7913 c (nhi\u7879 t \u273 \u7897 , \u273 \u7897  \u7849 m, ch\u7881  s\u7889  UV, ch\u7845 t l\u432 \u7907 ng kh\'f4ng kh\'ed AQI) t\u7915  c\'e1c API th\u7901 i ti\u7871 t l\u7899 n (OpenWeatherMap, Tomorrow.io) b\'ean c\u7841 nh d\u7919  li\u7879 u do ng\u432 \u7901 i d\'f9ng \u273 \'f3ng g\'f3p. \
