\f1\b0  Cho ph\'e9p b\uc0\u7853 t/t\u7855 t c\'e1c l\u7899 p b\u7843 n \u273 \u7891  nh\u432  
\f2\i M\uc0\u7853 t \u273 \u7897  ng\u7853 p
\f1\i0 , 
