\f2\i \uc0\u272 i\u7875 m n\'f3ng k\u7865 t xe
\f1\i0  \uc0\u273 \u7875  ng\u432 \u7901 i d\'f9ng d\u7877  quan s\'e1t t\u7893 ng quan. \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

